WEBVTT

00:12:28.908 --> 00:12:31.999
in support of the Women's March
all over the world.

00:12:32.967 --> 00:12:36.081
The hat was not created
for any financial benefit.

00:12:36.105 --> 00:12:39.967
Like our religious symbols
created thousands of years ago,

00:12:39.991 --> 00:12:42.988
the hat was created
by the people, for the people

00:12:43.012 --> 00:12:48.939
to serve what I believe
is the highest benefit of branding:

00:12:48.963 --> 00:12:51.426
to unite people in the communication

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:52.705
of shared ideals.

00:12:54.002 --> 00:12:57.232
The pink pussyhat became
a mark for a movement.

00:12:57.256 --> 00:13:01.145
In a very short time,
two months,